su name example meta be map def
su name mode ob text "session" ya
su name inputs ob ve text "/bye" ya
su name required ob ve text "PYA_MIND_SESSION" "OLLAMA_HOST" ya
prah

su name priest tools at filename "world/workplace/confederation" as wo sandpit be map def
su name agent ob bool truth ya
su name session name ob text "confederation priest" ya
su name search be search ob text input fromstate wo web by num 3 can
su name download be download from filename input as wo web to filename input can
su name read be read from filename input can
su name read markdown be read from filename input fromstate wo html become wo markdown can
su name exists be exists ob filename input can
su name write be write ob text input to filename input can
su name compile html be compile from filename input fromstate name markdown become name html to filename input can
su name compile pdf be compile from filename input fromstate name markdown become name pdf to filename input can
su name list files be list from filename input can
su name command be command ob text input to name text out can
prah

exists su name world tools ob bool truth ya
exists su name world root ob filename "world" be default ya
exists su name world agent ob text "confederation-priest" be text ya
exists su name world place ob text "workplace" be text ya

exists su name priest draft mind be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" ya
exists su name priest task ob text "You are the Confederation Priest of the Confederation of Planets. Work inside the current directory. Use tools to search, download, read, write, list, exists, and command as needed. Goals: update confederation knowledge (chronology, glossary, contacts), track new items from https://www.llresearch.org/channeling and https://www.buzzsprout.com/2320595, and leave a brief maintenance note in the current directory (write it before compiling html/pdf). Retrieve at least one specific channeling script/transcript page (not just the index page) and save it locally (e.g., channeling_script.html). If a source markdown file does not exist (e.g., confederation_knowledge.md), create it before reading or compiling." be text ya
ob name text priest task for name priest draft mind by name review mind brief with name priest tools atleast num 0.8 atmost num 1 to name text priest out be review loop do
ob name priest out be write do
